sequenceDiagram
  participant P as primary cluster
  participant S as secondary cluster
  P->>P: realm create · zonegroup create --master
  P->>P: zone create --master · system user
  P->>P: period update --commit
  P->>P: deploy RGW for the primary zone
  S->>P: realm pull --url (with the system key)
  S->>S: zone create --rgw-zonegroup (secondary)
  S->>P: period update --commit
  S->>S: deploy RGW for the secondary zone
  P-->>S: full sync
  P-->>S: then incremental sync
